Expose read-only GET /observer/endpoints returning native sgl-router worker
registry membership and single-lock circuit-breaker snapshots without mutating
routing state, claiming half-open probe slots, or emitting routing metrics.

AGAINST: sgl-project/sglang router-v0.1.0 (commit
7fed639806be1b03ef4eaba3fc4ad2117a8f2be4). Applied from the sparse clone root
(/src) against sgl-router/ and rust/.

WHEN TO REMOVE: when upstream sgl-router ships a native read-only membership
endpoint matching the operator observer wire contract.

